I was Dobanaki, a samurai, who had completed his class quest and was
heading down into the depths of the dungeon.  I came to a strange level
with a large lake and a fortress to the right side.  I kept getting messages
saying things like "you feel psychic waves washing over you" but having 
never seen a mind flayer before, I didn't have any idea what was going on.
I navigated the treacherously thin walkways toward the fortress, and when
I reached it, I found no way in.  Rather than wasting a bunch of time
searching around, Dobanaki thought "Hah!  I shall not trifle with silly
searching!  I shall teleport myself in!" which he did.

Dobanaki the Brave found himself face to face with an "h".  He though
to himself, "Ho!  What is a lowly dwarf doing down here on level 23?
Well, I shall righteously slice him into Julienne fries with my trusty
Snickersnee!"  Dobanaki charged forward, blade swinging, and struck a
mighty blow, one that would have slain any dwarf five times over.  "Hmm,
that's odd," thought Dobanaki as his opponent still stood.  Then he
noticed that it was a few feet taller than a dwarf and had the head of
an octopus, a head with tentacles which were in the process of entering
the eye sockets of his helmetless head.  Unfortunately, Dobanaki had
but 6 intelligence (which should be obvious by now), so with a few sucks,
the mind-flayer-in-dwarf's-clothing had removed all of his skull's contents.
With his dissolving brainstem (where his last point of intelligence was
attempting to avoid capture) Dobanaki thought "Hah!  Silly mind flayer does
not know that Dobanaki-san wearing amulet of life saving!"

Well, when his brains had been completely removed, Dobanaki's amulet glowed,
and his silent heart was jolted back into beating, and his cooling blood
once again surged in his veins.  Unfortunately, however, Dobanaki was
caught on a technicality, that being that he still had no grey matter,
and he promptly re-died.

From that day forward (that is until yesterday, when a stupid archaeologist
deposed him) the third position on the high score list read thusly:

3    Dobanaki-S killed on level 23.    151 [170]   333606
     Killed by brainlessness.
